    "detailed_description": "Game Title: &quot;Swordplay\uff5eKarakuri\uff5eStrange Tale&quot;<br />\r\n<br />\r\nOverview:<br />\r\n&quot;Swordplay\uff5eKarakuri\uff5eStrange Tale&quot; is a Japanese-style 3D action game set in a world where advanced &quot;karakuri&quot; technology is prevalent. Players can immerse themselves in a world inspired by both &quot;karakuri&quot; mechanisms and the late Edo period, enjoying slapstick theatrics in a rural setting.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nFeatures:<br />\r\n<br />\r\n3D Action: Experience the world of &quot;karakuri&quot; by utilizing jumping and evasive maneuvers.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nSpecial Moves: Special moves are implemented through command inputs. Mastering them will provide advantages for progressing through the game.<br />\r\n<br />\r\n\u3000",
